From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CubeSat OBC Dev <dev@cubesat-obc.local>
Date: Mon, 10 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: exclude cross-compilation targets from POSIX arch

The Pico SDK sets CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME to "PICO" rather than the CMake
convention "Generic".  libcsp's platform-detection block:

    if(UNIX AND NOT CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME STREQUAL "Generic")
      set(CSP_POSIX 1)
    endif()

evaluates to TRUE on a Linux host cross-compiling for RP2350, so
CSP_POSIX gets set to 1 as a normal CMake variable.  Two downstream
effects break the Pico build:

1. configure_file() generates autoconfig.h with #define CSP_POSIX 1,
   so csp_semaphore.h tries to #include <semaphore.h> — absent in the
   arm-none-eabi sysroot.

2. arch/CMakeLists.txt enters posix/ whose find_package(Threads REQUIRED)
   fails for arm-none-eabi.

Fix both at the source by adding NOT CMAKE_CROSSCOMPILING to the POSIX
detection guard, and add a safety belt in arch/CMakeLists.txt.

 CMakeLists.txt          | 5 +++--
 src/arch/CMakeLists.txt | 5 ++++-
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -57,8 +57,10 @@ endif()
 # --------------------------------------------------
 # PLATFORM DETECTION (FIXED)
 # --------------------------------------------------
 
-# POSIX = Linux + macOS + BSD
-if(UNIX AND NOT CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME STREQUAL "Generic")
+# POSIX = Linux + macOS + BSD; exclude cross-compilation targets (e.g. Pico
+# SDK sets CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME to "PICO" not CMake's "Generic" convention, so
+# the STREQUAL "Generic" guard alone is insufficient).
+if(UNIX AND NOT CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME STREQUAL "Generic" AND NOT CMAKE_CROSSCOMPILING)
   set(CSP_POSIX 1)
 endif()
 
diff --git a/src/arch/CMakeLists.txt b/src/arch/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/src/arch/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/arch/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,4 +1,8 @@
-if(CSP_POSIX)
+# When CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME is not "Generic" (e.g. Pico SDK sets it to "PICO"),
+# libcsp's platform detection sets CSP_POSIX=1 even for cross-compilation
+# targets.  Guard with NOT CMAKE_CROSSCOMPILING so embedded/FreeRTOS builds
+# fall through to the freertos arch.
+if(CSP_POSIX AND NOT CMAKE_CROSSCOMPILING)
   add_subdirectory(posix)
 elseif(CSP_FREERTOS)
   add_subdirectory(freertos)
